  "description": "OFX (ofx.com) exchange-rate provider for Bodu.Financial. Fetches and parses the OFX public spot-rate-history JSON service and serves the results as Bodu.Financial.ExchangeRates.ExchangeRate values through IDatedRateProvider and IRateProvider, with an async range API over arbitrary currency pairs. Includes the dependency-injection registration extensions (AddOfxExchangeRates) that bind OfxRateProviderOptions and configure a resilient named HttpClient.",
